  "releaseNotes": "0.6.2 adds explicit conversion to sRGB from ICC v2/v4 RGB and Gray matrix/TRC profiles and PNG gAMA/cHRM/sRGB descriptions (ConvertToSrgb, DecoderOptions.ColorConversion), reads and writes the PNG color chunks, and offers linear-light resizing and compositing (ResizeOptions.LinearLight, DrawImageOptions). Default results are unchanged. Notes: https://github.com/art-ix/PictureSharp/blob/v0.6.2/docs/releases/release-0.6.2.md",
